# format_note : This header is parsed as YAML after all leading whitespace is stripped, so keep every entry on one line and avoid apostrophes
# name : LRIS-2 R400 grating efficiency
# description : Efficiency of the R400 grating assembly for the LRIS-2 red arm
# author : BPH
# source : LRIS2_ETC data/throughput/R400_tot_eff.csv
# date_created : 2026-08-21
# date_modified : 2026-08-21
# status : grating efficiency, from the LRIS-2 ETC data files
# type : grating:transmission
# action : transmission
# wavelength_unit : um
# notes :
# - GRATING ONLY. The tot_eff name in the source file means the grating assembly has several
# - components, not that this is a total system throughput. It excludes the telescope, ADC,
# - collimator, dichroic, camera and detector QE, all of which are applied separately.
# - Nonzero only between 0.550 and 1.000 um. Those limits are how the source
# - file was masked to its own arm, not a measured grating cutoff. Harmless here because the
# - dichroic already cuts at the same place, but do not reuse this curve with a different dichroic.
# changes :
# - 2026-08-21 (BPH) converted from the ETC csv, nm to um
#
